{"4895470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fractal.OS", "steam_appid": 4895470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/6bf3788f7be62ac10afa0372f91ce41a.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one board. Play <strong>tic-tac-toe</strong>, earn resources, buy space, and place more boards. <strong>Wins, losses, and draws all feed the machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/5a7f81dd5a40428095ae471a77c5a7ca.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>26,830 unique tic-tac-toe games.</strong> Simple rules hide a complex system: layout, automation, colors, and grid shape become tools for <strong>steering matches</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you advance, the more you need to <strong>understand</strong> the machine you created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/f6035c0bbec8ccc524f2a7b380fe36d4.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Format</strong> your run and start again with <strong>permanent changes</strong>. New rules alter board behavior, resources, and <strong>your control over randomness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/d3c5476eb1387803e690f7bf5b22f478.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> a growing tic-tac-toe factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use every outcome:</strong> wins, losses, and draws matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your topology</strong> to influence thousands of games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige</strong> to unlock permanent rule changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obey the system.</strong> It insists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic-tac-toe was solved decades ago. Fractal.OS seems unconvinced.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/6bf3788f7be62ac10afa0372f91ce41a.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one board. Play <strong>tic-tac-toe</strong>, earn resources, buy space, and place more boards. <strong>Wins, losses, and draws all feed the machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/05c03f5ca65ae6696a1a1acdb4188e7b.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/5a7f81dd5a40428095ae471a77c5a7ca.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>26,830 unique tic-tac-toe games.</strong> Simple rules hide a complex system: layout, automation, colors, and grid shape become tools for <strong>steering matches</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you advance, the more you need to <strong>understand</strong> the machine you created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/8f34e5dc935fa6e395b9d3360dd988bb.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/f6035c0bbec8ccc524f2a7b380fe36d4.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Format</strong> your run and start again with <strong>permanent changes</strong>. New rules alter board behavior, resources, and <strong>your control over randomness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.poster.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.webm?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/25e35787ecf43d875d537a1392049a28.mp4?t=1783517911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/extras/d3c5476eb1387803e690f7bf5b22f478.avif?t=1783517911\" width=1170 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> a growing tic-tac-toe factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use every outcome:</strong> wins, losses, and draws matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your topology</strong> to influence thousands of games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige</strong> to unlock permanent rule changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obey the system.</strong> It insists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic-tac-toe was solved decades ago. Fractal.OS seems unconvinced.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Fractal.OS insists you play tic-tac-toe. Again. And again. Build an automated board factory, earn resources, unlock rules, and bend thousands of random matches toward a single impossible task: lose 10,000 times in a row. The system appreciates your compliance.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Dutch, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Arabic", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/cec0b41c4c4b2ec46e0953117c0ed96776af12dd/header.jpg?t=1783517911", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/36dc64f38a3db6be4a00623a11b28fadd21bf4cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783517911", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895470/36dc64f38a3db6be4a00623a11b28fadd21bf4cc/capsule_184x